The shared off-chain quote path floors collateral WAD down to native token units for provider calldata, which is consistent only if the submitted `maxAmount` and Ajna’s actual callback collateral land on the same native-unit value. I’m checking the take sizing helper and tests around mixed decimals to make sure this does not become an exact-balance mismatch.
